DOCUMENT();
loadMacros(
"PGstandard.pl",
"MathObjects.pl",
"PGML.pl"
);
Context("Numeric");
Context()->operators->undefine('+','-','*','/');

BEGIN_PGML
# Questions:

_For arithmetic problems, if the result is not an integer, then retain *three significant digits*._

What is the value of [`10+12+15+14*2`]? [_____]{Formula('65')}
---

[`7+10*12`] is equal to [_____]{Formula('127')}
---

What is the value of [`11+3-15`]? [_____]{Real(-1.)}
---

[`17+8-10*8`] is equal to [_____]{answer=>Real(-55.),width=>9}
---

What is the value of [`15+11-4+16*4`]? [_____]{86}
---
END_PGML
ENDDOCUMENT();
